          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Msipokee fidia yoyote kuokoa maisha ya mwuaji aliyepatikana na hatia, akahukumiwa kifo; mtu huyo lazima auawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msipokee wala msikubali fidia yoyote kutoka kwa mtu aliyekimbilia mji wa makimbilio ili kumruhusu arudi kukaa nyumbani kwake kabla ya kifo cha kuhani mkuu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkifanya hivyo mtakuwa mnaitia unajisi nchi ambayo mnakaa. Umwagaji damu huitia nchi unajisi, na hakuna sadaka iwezayo kuitakasa nchi iliyofanyiwa mauaji isipokuwa kwa kumuua mwuaji huyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msiitie unajisi nchi ambayo mnakaa, nchi ambayo mimi ninakaa; maana mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu ninakaa miongoni mwenu Waisraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.34"
            ]
          }
        }
